{"id":"n39545-1-9","stage":3,"title":"껴안다 · 拥抱","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n39545-1-9-1","ko":"아기가 계속 울면 어떻게 해?","zh":"如果宝宝一直哭怎么办？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아기가","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"울면","meaning":"哭，哭泣","explanation":"울다：哭，哭泣；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"울다","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69523","senseId":"1","lemma":"울다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해?","meaning":"办理，处置，分配","explanation":"하다：办理，处置，分配；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"13","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d5fa7c0faafdc9fc","term":"아기","zh":"小孩，婴儿","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3","entryId":"20235","definition":"吃着奶的非常幼小的孩子。","pronunciation":["아기"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"7136d2464083681e","term":"울다","zh":"哭，哭泣","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3","entryId":"69523","definition":"因为伤心、疼痛或太高兴而忍不住流眼泪；或指一边那样流眼泪一边发出声音。","pronunciation":["울ː다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"办理，处置，分配","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"处理事情或问题。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c245d0b8f15ff0675745.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n39545-1-9-2","ko":"아기를 앞으로 껴안고 토닥토닥 두드려 주면 울음을 그쳐.","zh":"把宝宝抱在怀里，轻轻拍抚他，他就会停止哭泣。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아기를","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞으로","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"5","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"껴안고","meaning":"拥抱，搂住","explanation":"껴안다：拥抱，搂住；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"껴안다","audio":"/audio/b2f0480642dd230fe8e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"39545","senseId":"1","lemma":"껴안다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"토닥토닥","meaning":"轻轻拍打的样子或声音（这里指轻拍宝宝）","explanation":"토닥토닥：轻轻拍打的样子或声音（这里指轻拍宝宝）","readings":[{"term":"토닥토닥","audio":"/audio/04cf1994532d08949b18.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91323","senseId":"1","lemma":"토닥토닥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"두드려","meaning":"敲，拍打","explanation":"두드리다：敲，拍打；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"두드리다","audio":"/audio/f07545c162724f388e85.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67476","senseId":"1","lemma":"두드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주면","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"울음을","meaning":"哭泣，哭","explanation":"울음：哭泣，哭；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"울음","audio":"/audio/cc40889db0d47966af9d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69526","senseId":"1","lemma":"울음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그쳐.","meaning":"停止，结束","explanation":"그치다：停止，结束；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그치다","audio":"/audio/d2e1c5743fe04efc2512.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29775","senseId":"1","lemma":"그치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d5fa7c0faafdc9fc","term":"아기","zh":"小孩，婴儿","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3","entryId":"20235","definition":"吃着奶的非常幼小的孩子。","pronunciation":["아기"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"人体或物体的前面部分。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"b2f0480642dd230f","term":"껴안다","zh":"拥抱，搂住","audio":"/audio/b2f0480642dd230fe8e3.mp3","entryId":"39545","definition":"双臂合抱。","pronunciation":["껴안따"]},{"id":"04cf1994532d0894","term":"토닥토닥","zh":"轻轻拍打的样子或声音（这里指轻拍宝宝）","audio":"/audio/04cf1994532d08949b18.mp3","entryId":"91323","definition":"轻轻拍打的样子或声音（这里指轻拍宝宝）","pronunciation":["토닥토닥"]},{"id":"f07545c162724f38","term":"두드리다","zh":"敲，拍打","audio":"/audio/f07545c162724f388e85.mp3","entryId":"67476","definition":"连续敲击或打击使其发出声音。","pronunciation":["두드리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"cc40889db0d47966","term":"울음","zh":"哭泣，哭","audio":"/audio/cc40889db0d47966af9d.mp3","entryId":"69526","definition":"指有声地流泪。","pronunciation":["우름"]},{"id":"d2e1c5743fe04efc","term":"그치다","zh":"停止，结束","audio":"/audio/d2e1c5743fe04efc2512.mp3","entryId":"29775","definition":"一直持续的事情、动作、现象等不再继续，停下来。","pronunciation":["그치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/38b256b16e992cdefdac.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.175,"source":{"url":"